Sleep on LAN\par
\par
Sleep on LAN is distributed under the license included with this project.\par
\par
By installing Sleep on LAN, you allow it to install a local Windows Service and firewall rules for UDP ports 7 and 9 so this computer can respond to inverse Wake-on-LAN sleep packets.\par
